{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","火舞流炎"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","持续对敌人造成伤害，期间处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","萨忒娜跳起巫舞，对周围2格的敌人造成共240% ATK伤害，期间自身处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":36,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能的最后一击会魅惑敌人2 + 0.25秒，敌人被魅惑期间仅会使用普通攻击。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":21,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":11,"tooltip_key":"keyword:enchanted"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至280% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至300% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","火狐冲刺"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对扇形范围的敌人造成伤害，并附带生命汲取。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","爪击面前1格扇形范围内的敌人，造成两次110% ATK伤害，每次附带目标最大生命值2.5% + 0.5%的额外伤害，额外伤害最高不超过萨忒娜75% + 10%的攻击力。本技能造成的伤害还会额外附带100点生命汲取。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":45,"end":52,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":27,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至115% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至120% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至130% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","热情洋溢"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身及周围的友军攻击敌人会使其被“点燃”，降低受愈并持续受到伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗开始时使用，使自身2格范围的友军继承火种。敌人累计受到萨忒娜或继承火种的友军造成的3次伤害时，将会被“点燃”，每1秒受到0.8% + 0.2%的最大生命值伤害并降低20点受愈，该伤害最高不超过萨忒娜45% + 5%的攻击力，持续至战斗结束。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":74,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg6"},{"start":105,"end":110,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","当所有敌方英雄或累计5名敌方英雄被“点燃”时，降低受愈提升至60点。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至1% + 0.2%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":7,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg6"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","当所有敌方英雄或累计5名敌方英雄被“点燃”时，伤害提升至2%的最大生命值。"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身受到的伤害降低。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低12%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的受到的伤害降低20%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","星火祝福"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“点燃”敌人使得自身和友军受到魔法伤害降低。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","点燃一名敌方英雄时，自身受到魔法伤害降低16%，持续至战斗结束。每多点燃一名敌方英雄，萨忒娜就会使最近的一名友军获得该效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每点燃一名敌方英雄，自身回复200点能量。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","受到魔法伤害降低效果提升至20%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","受到魔法伤害降低效果提升至22%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","所有敌人被“点燃”时，“火狐冲刺”不再拥有冷却时间。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当所有敌方英雄或累计5名敌方英雄被“点燃”时，“火狐冲刺”不再拥有冷却时间。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“点燃”造成的伤害提升100%，并且原“点燃”5名英雄触发的效果将会在“点燃”4名英雄时即可触发。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","阳炎魔晶"]]}